Package: RcmdrShinyPlugin.sos
Type: Package
Title: Search R Help Pages from RcmdrShiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("RcmdrShiny", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "vigliafg@gmail.com"),
    person("Liviu", "Andronic", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of RcmdrPlugin.sos")
  )
Description: RcmdrShiny interface to the 'sos' package.  It searches R help
    pages, supports multiple terms with union or intersection, filters results
    by column and optionally writes them to a spreadsheet.  Derived from
    RcmdrPlugin.sos 0.3-0.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    RcmdrShiny (>= 1.1.0),
    htmltools
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    sos
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/vigliafg/rstats-commander
BugReports: https://github.com/vigliafg/rstats-commander/issues
